{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19995","headline":"寒溪 八 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪风摆余冻，溪景衔明春。\n玉消花滴滴，虬解光鳞鳞。\n悬步下清曲，消期濯芳津。\n千里冰裂处，一勺暖亦仁。\n凝精互相洗，漪涟竞将新。\n忽如劒疮尽，初起百战身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}